{"id":"664406","name":"麻椒炒猪肝","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/664406/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肝","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"麻椒","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪肝洗净后稍冻一下好切。","img":"images/664406/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅中放入适量的食用油烧热，放入猪肝小火翻炒。","img":"images/664406/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"炒至断生即可（取出)。","img":"images/664406/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再放入麻椒丝、料酒、生抽、盐快速翻炒。","img":"images/664406/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入刚炒的猪肝快速翻炒出锅。","img":"images/664406/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"成品猪肝很嫩，搭配麻椒很可口。","img":"images/664406/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}